files.design/sessions/session.kind.mjs:
// chud's design-session record kind (jhgaylor/chud#78), data only: no
// imports, no code. chant reads it from 0.86.0 on (INTENTIUS/chant#2684,
// #2673):
//
//   chant workspace records --json
//   chant workspace records --kind design/sessions/session.kind.mjs --since <open> --at <close> --json
//
// A session is where people review contracts, drivers, splits and release
// gates together, with a facilitator that prepares and never gives a verdict.
// It is open, then closed, and a closed session never changes: `seal` is
// chant's seal for a JSON session kind, the lowercase hex sha256 of the file
// with LF line endings and without its top-level `seal` member (and the comma
// before it), which chant checks on every read (session-seal-mismatch).
//
// `verdicts` are the verdicts the session produced, in chant's shape
// { record, principal, verdict, digest? } (jhgaylor/chud#95): one per entry of
// chud's own `approvals` ({ kind, id, digest, by, roles, at }, what the quorum
// is tallied over), in the same order and written with it. `principal` is the
// approver and `verdict` is agree. `record` is the decision the approval
// produced, once there is one (a contract or a split approved at its quorum),
// with `digest`, the decision's digest; chant checks it against the subjects.
// An approval that produced no decision (a driver's sign-off, a gate, one
// short of its quorum) names its contract, driver, split or gate only under
// `x-chud`. Decisions made in a session name it in their own records.
//
// session.schema.json is @intentius/chud-runtime's schemas/session.schema.json
// byte for byte, and ../schemas/defs.schema.json is its defs.schema.json;
// chud's tests fail when they drift. chud writes these files itself (chant's
// write verbs refuse JSON kinds) and reads each write back through chant.
export const recordKind = {
  name: "session",
  location: { dir: ".", match: "^S-[0-9]+\\.json$" },
  format: "json",
  schema: {
    id: "https://schemas.intentius.dev/chud-runtime/v0/session.schema.json",
    path: "session.schema.json",
    refs: [{ id: "https://schemas.intentius.dev/chud-runtime/v0/defs.schema.json", path: "../schemas/defs.schema.json" }],
  },
  idField: "id",
  stateField: "status",
  states: ["open", "closed"],
  closedStates: ["closed"],
  session: {
    verdicts: "verdicts",
    seal: "seal",
    subjects: { kind: "../../decisions/decision.kind.mjs" },
  },
};

